00:29:38.070 --> 00:29:40.780
when I'm, I feel like I'm
alive when I get high.

00:29:40.780 --> 00:29:45.390
So, that's why I'm keep doing it.

00:29:45.390 --> 00:29:46.630
- [Mark] That's a problem.

00:29:46.630 --> 00:29:48.450
- I know, that's problem.

00:29:48.450 --> 00:29:50.170
So, that's problem.

00:29:50.170 --> 00:29:53.790
