00:29:59.870 --> 00:30:03.550
then some people cheering me up

00:30:03.550 --> 00:30:06.413
and then I know for now to still,

00:30:08.010 --> 00:30:10.070
yeah, my people is there.

00:30:10.070 --> 00:30:13.747
So I don't know, like
many people hating me.

00:30:19.020 --> 00:30:21.420
Almost like everybody's staring me.

00:30:21.420 --> 00:30:23.560
Like, I felt like I'm fighting

00:30:23.560 --> 00:30:24.760
against the whole world.

00:30:26.340 --> 00:30:31.340
