00:30:47.830 --> 00:30:49.790
Homeless people, like I'm homeless now,

00:30:49.790 --> 00:30:53.300
but even though when I
wasn't homeless back then,

00:30:53.300 --> 00:30:54.187
still I go,

00:30:54.187 --> 00:30:57.230
