00:31:06.400 --> 00:31:07.390
everything is...

00:31:08.440 --> 00:31:10.007
- [Mark] Are you happier now--
- Yeah.

00:31:10.007 --> 00:31:11.143
- [Mark] Than you were--
- Yeah.

00:31:11.143 --> 00:31:13.000
