00:31:13.000 --> 00:31:13.833
- Yeah.

00:31:13.833 --> 00:31:14.850
- [Mark] Really?

00:31:14.850 --> 00:31:16.227
So, that's going to be hard.

00:31:16.227 --> 00:31:18.120
- It is going to be,

00:31:18.120 --> 00:31:20.160
but this is me.

00:31:20.160 --> 00:31:22.553
- [Mark] Stop and be
unhappy like the rest of us.

00:31:22.553 --> 00:31:23.386
(Mark laughs)

00:31:23.386 --> 00:31:24.890
- I don't know.

00:31:24.890 --> 00:31:26.000
I don't know.

00:31:26.000 --> 00:31:26.833
So I'm scared.

00:31:26.833 --> 00:31:29.490
So this is, I'm still, maybe.

00:31:29.490 --> 00:31:32.090
I went to rehab many times,

00:31:32.090 --> 00:31:37.074
