working really diligently.

00:31:37.074 --> 00:31:38.206
So I know all the step--

00:31:38.206 --> 00:31:40.325
- [Mark] It's very hard
and it's very difficult.

00:31:40.325 --> 00:31:41.270
You're trying to do something
you really don't want to do.

00:31:41.270 --> 00:31:43.860
- Yeah, but that is some kind of,

00:31:43.860 --> 00:31:44.930
I don't know.

00:31:44.930 --> 00:31:48.700
Right now, actually drug is not...

00:31:50.548 --> 00:31:55.548
Sometime I want to stop drug, smoking.

00:31:57.510 --> 00:32:00.340
But my wish is like,

00:32:00.340 --> 00:32:03.070
