00:32:25.470 --> 00:32:26.303
- No?

00:32:26.303 --> 00:32:27.136
- [Mark] No children?

00:32:27.136 --> 00:32:27.969
- No children.

00:32:29.830 --> 00:32:30.700
- [Mark] I'm not saying that's the answer.

00:32:30.700 --> 00:32:31.533
