be over very quickly.

00:33:23.970 --> 00:33:24.803
I don't know.

00:33:26.100 --> 00:33:30.290
So all I really need is some, kind of,

00:33:31.800 --> 00:33:33.263
I don't know how to finish.

00:33:36.170 --> 00:33:38.129
