00:34:01.284 --> 00:34:02.474
I don't know.

00:34:02.474 --> 00:34:03.307
No, actually, I'm just, I don't know,

00:34:05.840 --> 00:34:07.780
I'm still like growing, so.

00:34:07.780 --> 00:34:09.320
